{
  "dom_id": "step-t9205",
  "name": "Perfect Square Quadratic Equations With No Real Solutions",
  "problem": "Let's try and solve the equation $(x+1)^2=-1$ using the square root method.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+1)^{2} & =-1 \\\\ \\sqrt{(x+1)^{2}} & =\\sqrt{-1} \\\\ |x+1| & =\\sqrt{-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe have a problem here. We cannot take the square root of a negative number. For that reason, the equation above has *no real solutions*.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t9205\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Perfect Square Quadratic Equations With No Real Solutions</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t9205\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n               